<p>You swap your bullets for more massive ones for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p>When striking a creature, these bullets have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">27%, 34%, 39%, 42%, 46%</acronym> chance of knocking it back 3 tiles and a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">11%, 16%, 20%, 23%, 26%</acronym> chance of stunning it for 3 turns.</p><p>The chances to knockback and stun increase with your Steampower.</p><p>Only one bullet enhancement can be used at once.</p>